<title>SINGAPORE: TABLE - ST SHIPBUILDING 1H PROFIT UP 4.9 PCT.</title>
<headline>TABLE - ST SHIPBUILDING 1H PROFIT UP 4.9 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>		   (in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			 18.49    vs     17.62</p>
<p>    Group share (cents)	     9.5     vs	9.0</p>
<p>    Turnover			  119.35    vs    161.04</p>
<p>    Other income incl int.	  7.26    vs	4.42</p>
<p>Operating profit before tax</p>
<p>    interest/depreciation	  31.54    vs     29.20</p>
<p>    Depreciation			6.09    vs	5.45</p>
<p>    Associates			 (0.35)   vs	0.04</p>
<p>    Taxation			    6.62    vs	6.17</p>
<p>Note - Full name is Singapore Technologies Shipbuilding &amp; Engineering Ltd.</p>
<p>--Singapore newsroom (65 870 3080)</p>
